1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,450
Go to mlh.com and open MyMLH sign-in / sign-up

2
00:00:06,467 --> 00:00:10,889
Create your account: enter your first and last name

3
00:00:10,889 --> 00:00:14,100
Tick the Terms of Service box, then tap Sign Up!

4
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,100
Account created: Welcome to MyMLH!

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,331
Complete your profile: fill in the required fields

6
00:00:19,331 --> 00:00:23,023
Your own answers go here (hidden for privacy)

7
00:00:23,023 --> 00:00:27,500
Add your education: search and select your school

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,033
Add a start date, or tick Currently in school

9
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:35,033
Add your birthday, then tap Continue

10
00:00:35,033 --> 00:00:37,986
Next: Global Hack Week registration questions

11
00:00:37,986 --> 00:00:42,222
Tick the required agreements, then tap Submit

12
00:00:42,222 --> 00:00:45,033
Done: you're registered for the event

13
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:48,558
Now open hacktoberfest.com and log in with MLH

14
00:00:48,558 --> 00:00:51,867
Tap Authorize to connect Hacktoberfest 2026

15
00:00:51,867 --> 00:00:52,992
Loading your codes and offers...

16
00:00:52,992 --> 00:00:58,100
Scroll down to the ElevenLabs card

17
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,783
ElevenLabs: 1 Month Free

18
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,400
Read the offer terms carefully

19
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,200
1 month of the Creator tier, no credit card required

20
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,200
Needs a verified phone and a connected GitHub on MyMLH

21
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,200
Then tap Get your code (not shown in this recording)
